flowchart LR
    accTitle: The learning evidence loop
    accDescr: Learn, practice, complete a knowledge check, revise from feedback when needed, record verified evidence in a transcript, and earn a badge after completing the path.

    L[Learn a focused concept] --> P[Practice with a real task]
    P --> K[Complete the knowledge check]
    K --> F{Meets the evidence threshold?}
    F -->|Not yet: use feedback| P
    F -->|Yes| T[Record score and evidence in transcript]
    T --> C{Path complete?}
    C -->|No| L
    C -->|Yes| B([Award evidence-based badge])
